                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, partial plate armour, lance, shield and warhorse. May have cloth barding (+4 pts); may not take a bow. First Charge. Eastern Shock Cavalry. At least one unit of Junior Druzhniks must be taken if the army includes a unit of Senior Druzhniks. In armies of the Western Russian States Senior Druzhniks cost 36 points. 0-1 unit. (Armies of Chivalry p.48)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="1000-77aa-0c02-6652" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">3+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <modifiers>
                <!-- armour-save -->
              <modifier type="set" field="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024" value="2+ with Cloth barding +1 in hand-to-hand only">
                <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="d8c7-6f05-27a0-649d" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="de9f-842a-ce82-c3ad" type="atLeast"/>
                </conditions>
              </modifier>
              </modifiers>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="e668-408c-349c-4324" name="First Charge (Chivalry)" hidden="false" targetId="bd4c-eca0-b780-4ba5" type="rule"/>
