              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, shield and light armour. May take a thrusting spear (+2 pts) or replace shield with a two-handed weapon (+1 pt). Combined Formation - may have up to 50% Urban Militia Archers in the rear ranks of the unit. (Armies of Chivalry p.49)</characteristic>
