              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Improvised weapons. May have either a bow (+2 pts) or a shield (+1 pt). Rural Levies: Fear enemies they do not outnumber by at least two to one. They do not fear other levies or skirmishers. (Armies of Chivalry p.49)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="9f2f-dcfc-6d5a-6def" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
