              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, light armour, thrusting spear and horse. May have a shield (+2 pts) and half-barding (+4 pts). Open Order and Nomad Cavalry. Tartar Nobles may only be taken in the armies of the Eastern Russian States. 0-1 unit. (Armies of Chivalry p.49)</characteristic>
