              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each gun has a crew of three; two additional crew may be added (+10 pts each). Crewmen have hand weapon and light armour and may upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). Light artillery range 36", Strength 6. Artillery: up to one gun for every 1,000 army points (bought from the Infantry allocation). Up to one gun for every 1,000 army points in Western Russian States armies and up to one gun for every 1,500 army points in Eastern Russian States armies. (Armies of Chivalry p.49)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
